- chunk/store: delete_range error now reports the key count; del_ops is
  documented as credited only on full-batch success; new test covers
  partial batch failure propagation + idempotent retry.
- tests: qlean integration tests gated to linux/x86_64, matching the
  dev-dependency gate in Cargo.toml (keeps cargo test --workspace
  compiling on macOS/aarch64).
- compact worker: document multi-threaded runtime requirement for the
  semaphore await in the spawn loop.
- bench comment updated (insert_hot no longer forces run_pending_tasks).
- doc/performance: record accepted 2026-08 perf changes with the CI
  focused-profile evidence.
